  "아무리": ["Qancha yesam ham qornim och.", "Qanchalik band bo'lsam ham, aloqaga chiqaman.", "Qanchalik qiyin bo'lmasin, taslim bo'lmang.", "Qancha o'ylamay, buning sababini tushunolmayapman.", "Qanchalik iste'dodli mutaxassis bo'lmasin, hamkorliksiz katta natijalarga erishish qiyin.", "Yillar qanchalik o'tmasin, dunyo qanchalik o'zgarmasin, onaning farzandiga bo'lgan o'sha o'zgarmas mehri aslo o'zgarmaydi."],
